      "content": "It can definitely feel like a big topic to talk about, but you can start with the idea that \"feelings on the inside are like a private part of you, and for some people, the way they feel on the inside is different from the way the world might think of them on the outside\n\n  You can use very simple, concrete examples to show that being a \"boy\" or a \"girl\" is like a big idea, not just one fixed thing\n\n  The most important thing is to listen to your 7-year-old and answer their specific questions in a calm, loving, and factual way tailored to their level of understanding.",
